        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah Paulson\n- TV Series: American Horror Story, Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip\n- Episodes: Blood Bath\n- Organizations: FX, NBC, Golden Globe Awards\n- Roles: Harriet Hayes\n\nFacts:\n- From 2006 to 2007, Sarah Paulson played Harriet Hayes in the NBC comedy-drama series \"Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip.\"\n- Sarah Paulson received her first Golden Globe Award nomination for her role as Harriet Hayes in \"Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip.\"\n- \"Blood Bath\" premiered on December 3, 2014 on FX as the eighth episode of the anthology television series \"American Horror Story.\"\n- \"Blood Bath\" was notable for being the first episode of \"American Horror Story\" that series veteran Sarah Paulson did not appear in since the show's beginning.",
